 ],
 "literal": "Playing with the sea and staying in the seaside grove / and celebrating the beautiful embrace with the garlanded playmates, / if he, coming suddenly like a stranger, / embraced her and left, indeed gossip would have arisen. / But, closer than the leaf garment of green sprouts / fastened from swaying branches, worn on her wide hips spread with beauty spots and adorned with perfect jewels, / he does not go away from her side. / He himself gave it; O mother, protect her carefully!",
 "translation": "If he had come suddenly like a stranger, embraced her, and gone away after we played in the sea, stayed in the seaside grove, and celebrated the festival of embraces with our garlanded playmates, gossip would have surely arisen. But he does not leave her side, staying even closer than the garment of fresh green leaves plucked from swaying branches that she wears on her wide hips adorned with beauty spots and perfect jewels. He himself gave this leaf garment to her. O mother, guard her well!",
 "modern": "கடலில் விளையாடியும், கடற்கரைச் சோலையில் தங்கியும், மாலை அணிந்த தோழியர் கூட்டத்துடன் தழுவி விளையாடியும் மகிழ்ந்தோம். அப்போது அவன் ஒரு புதியவனைப் போலத் திடீரென்று வந்து, அவளைத் தழுவிவிட்டுச் சென்றிருந்தால் ஊரார் அலர் தூற்றியிருப்பார்கள். ஆனால், அழகிய புள்ளிகள் படர்ந்த அவளது அகன்ற அல்குலில், அசையும் கிளைகளிலிருந்து பறித்துக் கட்டிய பசுமையான தழையாடையை விடவும் நெருக்கமாக அவன் எப்போதும் அவளது பக்கத்திலேயே இருக்கிறான். அந்தத் தழையாடையையும் அவனே அவளுக்குத் தந்தான். தாயே! நீ அவளைப் பாதுகாப்பாயாக!",
 "explanation": "In this poem of the Neytal (coastal) landscape, the friend (tōḻi) is revealing the heroine's secret love affair to the foster-mother (aṟattoṭu niṟṟal). She explains that the hero is not a passing stranger who would embrace the heroine and leave, causing scandalous gossip. Instead, he is deeply committed and stays closer to her than the very leaf garment she wears. This leaf garment, made of fresh green sprouts from swaying branches, was gifted by the hero himself as a token of courtship. By sharing this, the friend gently urges the mother to accept their love and protect the heroine by preparing for their marriage.",
 "model": "gemini-3.5-flash",
 "generated": "2026-11-27"
}